      "content": "It's all so heavy. I feel like I'm just waiting for the ground to swallow me whole. There's no way to fix what happened, is there? No matter what I do, the debt remains. It feels like the only thing left to do is find some kind of peace, some way to balance the scales before the morning comes.",
